        "TileImage": "$($repository 1ea813c8-038d-473a-aecb-ac9afe0adbdb).Image",
        "Description": "This is very unusual for your standards, but on this one, bring the Shashka. No, 47, these are no jokes. Head to Goldberg, Lygner &amp; Schyster in New York. Your only job - Panic, havoc and complete destruction. The bank appears to have affiliation with the AAS, and that is a dangerous combination of powers. Go in, throw some explosives, kill a few, escape. This is not what you were trained for, but sometimes, things do not come out as we think they would. Good luck, or dare I say, good aim.",
